+| `minimum_mode` | Optional inner radius in the same space. When set, only modes with \(n_{\min}\le\lVert\boldsymbol{n}\rVert_2\le n_{\max}\) are forced: a shell at a forcing scale, as 2D double-cascade runs force, rather than the ball that includes the box scale. Must not exceed `maximum_mode`. |
 
